  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 504.10 )",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 504.10)\n\n#10135, eff 5-23-12\n\nThe prior filings affecting the repealed rules in Part Saf-C 506 included the following documents after Document #7972:\n\n#8999, eff 9-29-07\n\n#9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12 (All rules except Saf-C 506.01)\n\n#10135, eff 5-23-12\n\nThe prior filings affecting the repealed Saf-C 511.03 included the following documents after Document #7972:\n\n#9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\n#10135, eff 5-23-12\n\n#12914, eff 11-6-19\n\nThe prior filings affecting the deleted Saf-C 512.03 and the repealed Saf-C 514.56 included the following documents after Document #7972:\n\n#9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12\n\n#10135, eff 5-23-12\n\nThe prior filings affecting the repealed Saf-C 521.01 included the following documents:\n\n#7069, effective 8-5-99, EXPIRED: 8-5-07\n\n#8999, effective 9-29-07\n\n#10135, effective 5-23-12\n\nThe rules which were last filed in Document #10135, effective 5-23-12, did not expire on 5-23-22 but were extended pursuant to RSA 541-A:14-a until Document #13512 was effective 1-13-23.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
